<title>USA: IMM currency futures end mostly higher.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures end mostly higher.</headline>
<text>
<p>May 6 - Most IMM currency futures ended light afternoon trade moderately higher. Action concentrated in morning rise, brief midday spurt up that stalled. Fundamentals for marks, Swiss, seen little-changed. Some debate yen outlook, given Nikkei rally, Japan rate-rise talk. June marks held trendline at $0.5814 but some expect more downside. Sterling seen bullish.</p>
